{"id":"gegenteil","lemma":"Gegenteil","pos":"noun","rank":1434,"glosses":["opposite (contrary thing)"],"ipa":"/ˈɡeːɡn̩taɪ̯l/","audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/b/b0/De-at-Gegenteil.ogg/De-at-Gegenteil.ogg.mp3","gender":"n","forms":{"genitive":"Gegenteiles","plural":"Gegenteile"},"examples":[{"text":"Das Gegenteil ist der Fall.","en":"The opposite is true.","words":[{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"fall, drop"}]},{"text":"\"Schnell\" ist das Gegenteil von \"langsam\".","en":"\"Fast\" is the opposite of \"slow.\"","words":[{"g":"quickly"},{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"from / of"},{"g":"slowly"}]},{"text":"Er tat das Gegenteil.","en":"He did the opposite.","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"deed"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Ich meinte das Gegenteil.","en":"I meant the opposite.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to opine, to think","l":"meinen"},{"g":"the / that"},null]},{"text":"Er hat mir genau das Gegenteil gesagt!","en":"He told me just the opposite!","words":[{"g":"he / it"},{"g":"has","l":"haben"},{"g":"(to) me","l":"ich"},{"g":"just, exactly"},{"g":"the / that"},null,{"g":"to say (to pronounce","l":"sagen"}]}]}